WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.753
This is a teaching lesson, not a live fire.

00:00:02.753 --> 00:00:09.797
The U.S. Fire Administration says people may have less than two minutes to get out after a smoke alarm sounds.

00:00:09.797 --> 00:00:16.776
This scene is a fictional one-story house with a ground-floor bedroom, not a tornado shelter and not a flood.
